<title>UK: Euromoney to raise stake in oil magazine.</title>
<headline>Euromoney to raise stake in oil magazine.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Euromoney Publications Plc said on Friday it conditionally agreed to buy an additional 15 percent stake in magazine publisher Petroleum Economist Ltd for 1.09 million stg.</p>
<p>Euromoney said the purchase from director Nigel Bance would raise its stake to 95 percent of Petroleum Economist's share capital and leave Bance with five percent.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Euromoney could buy Bance's remaining five percent stake for an amount capped at 2.0 million stg. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
